To find it: add outline: 2px solid red to thead tr in DevTools and count the rows. Fix the selector by scoping it to the body rows: tbody tr:nth-child(even). Because &lt;tbody&gt; contains only the data rows, the count starts fresh at Apple (child 1), making Banana (child 2) and Date (child 4) the even-numbered rows.

&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang="en"&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
  &lt;meta charset="utf-8"&gt;
  &lt;meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"&gt;
  &lt;title&gt;Wrong Swap Mode&lt;/title&gt;
