Open the page and check the browser console. Does a number appear next to “Items in cart”?
&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang="en"&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
  &lt;meta charset="utf-8"&gt;
  &lt;meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"&gt;
  &lt;title&gt;Store Not Registered&lt;/title&gt;
  &lt;script&gt;
    document.addEventListener('alpine:init', () =&gt; {
      // Alpine.store('cart', { count: 0 });
    });
  &lt;/script&gt;
  &lt;script defer src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/alpinejs@3.14.1/dist/cdn.min.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
  &lt;h1&gt;Display a count from a shared store&lt;/h1&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;Does a number appear next to "Items in cart"?
     Check the browser console for errors.&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;div x-data&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Items in cart: &lt;span x-text="$store.cart.count"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
